	"Description": "[center][size=5]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF❖[/size]\u00A0[b][size=5]Cow Replacers[/size]\u00A0\uFEFF[/b][size=5][b]❖[/b][/size][/center][center]\n<br />[size=4][i]How to Install[/i]\n<br />[/size]• Download and install the latest [url=https://smapi.io///]SMAPI[/url]\uFEFF and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />• Download and unzip \"K White Cow\" and/or \"K Brown Cow\"\n<br />• Select pattern folder you would like (Solid/Spots/etc) - inside are all the color variations of each pattern\n<br />• Move one folder starting with [C] to \uFEFF[i]&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Mods&#92;\n<br />\n<br />[/i]The mod folders are named according to what cow they replace and their pattern. For example,\u00A0[i][C] KCow White - Spots Blonde [/i]replaces the default white cow with a blonde spotted cow, and\u00A0\uFEFF[i][C] KCow Brown - Hereford Red [/i]replaces the default brown cow with a red hereford cow!\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy!\n<br />\n<br />[i][size=4]Other Animal Replacers\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2945][img]https://i.imgur.com/2dz28s8.png[/img]\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2964/][img]https://i.imgur.com/z7DirGZ.png[/img]\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF[/size][/i][i][size=4][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2996][img]https://i.imgur.com/7cgqEHI.png[/img][/url]\uFEFF[/size][/i][i][size=4]\n<br />[/size][/i][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2945]Pigs[/url]\uFEFF\u00A0\u00A0\uFEFF[b][size=2]❖\u00A0[/size][/b]\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2964/]Goats[/url]\uFEFF\u00A0\u00A0[size=2][b]❖\u00A0 [/b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2996]Sheep[/url]\uFEFF[/size][/center]",
